  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x610a" vislevel="1" flags="0xC">
    <title>VMax Speed Threshold</title>
    <description>[v1.01 CODE CONFIRMED] Main vehicle-speed limiter threshold. activate_RPM_limiter reads Vehicle_Speed (RAM 0x00FF832D) and compares it directly to this calibration byte with no conversion. The same Vehicle_Speed byte is used directly by lookup axes already established in km/h (equation X), and handler_Vehicle_Speed uses native state thresholds 55/60 and 115/120 in the same domain. Therefore 1 raw count = 1 km/h. Stock 205 = 205 km/h. A3B9 is subtracted for the lower hysteresis boundary (202 km/h stock) and A3B8 is added for the upper boundary (208 km/h stock). Original Bosch symbol name is unknown.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="15" />
    <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x02" mmedaddress="0x23A7" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
