    <title>RPM Limiter Offset Decay Step</title>
    <description>[BMS46 v0.46 CODE-DERIVED] A3B4 is subtracted from FF84EC by handler_RPM_Limiter. FF84EC is an RPM-count offset added into the RPM threshold path and compared in the FF8334 Engine_RPM byte domain. Therefore A3B4 is an RPM-count decay step. Q28G raw=1 -&gt; 40 RPM per handler update.</description>
