    <title>RPM Limiter Max Ignition Retard</title>
    <description>[BMS46 v0.46 CODE-DERIVED] A3B6 caps FF84F0. FF84F0 is subtracted directly from the ignition-angle byte in set_Engine_Timing_Advance, so one count equals the ignition domain step of 0.75 deg. Q28G stock raw=0, so this ramped retard contribution is stock-disabled.</description>
