  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x6247" vislevel="1" flags="0xC">
    <title>ICV Low Speed State Vehicle Speed Threshold</title>
    <description>[BMS46 v0.52 CODE-DERIVED] PROVISIONAL_CAL_CONSUMER_016452 compares Vehicle_Speed FF832D directly with 0x8A53 in two branches of the idle/ICV state machine (0x16B58 and 0x16BD6), using it to select low-speed/stationary idle-control behavior. FF832D has established 1 km/h per bit scaling. Q28G raw 3 -&gt; 3 km/h.</description>
