  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x6248" vislevel="1" flags="0xC">
    <title>Idle Throttle Processing Holdoff After Reset</title>
    <description>[BMS46 v0.52 CODE-DERIVED] Idle initialization copies 0x8AFF into FF8461. handler_Throttle_Position tests FF8461 and, while nonzero, decrements the byte instead of running the normal throttle-position processing path; the calibration is reloaded on the related idle reset path. Q28G raw=235. This is a controller-cycle holdoff/debounce counter; no wall-clock conversion is asserted.</description>
