    <title>ASC Internal Ramp Step Gain</title>
    <description>[BMS46 v0.52 CODE-DERIVED] PROVISIONAL_CAL_CONSUMER_02A5FE right-shifts the ASC ramp counter FF88F1 by 3, multiplies the result by 0x9A0B, then adds or subtracts that amount from the ASC base byte FF88EE before writing FF88F0. Q28G raw=2. This is therefore the internal ramp step gain; no external torque-unit conversion is asserted.</description>
