    <title>ASC Internal Output Minimum Clamp</title>
    <description>[BMS46 v0.52 CODE-DERIVED] PROVISIONAL_CAL_CONSUMER_02A470 computes an ASC output from FF859C minus the scaled FF8910*FF88EC term, sign-extends the result, compares it against 0x9A0D and writes 0x9A0D whenever the result is lower. Q28G raw=43. This is an explicit lower clamp in the internal ASC output domain.</description>
