    <title>ASC Correction Max RPM</title>
    <description>[BMS46 v0.52 CODE-DERIVED] PROVISIONAL_CAL_CONSUMER_02A470 compares Engine_RPM FF8334 directly with 0x9A0E before setting ASC state FF890F and explicitly clears that state when RPM is at/above the same threshold. FF8334 scaling is established as 40 RPM/bit. Q28G raw 95 -&gt; 3800 RPM. This is the upper RPM gate for this ASC correction branch.</description>
