  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x624E" vislevel="1" flags="0xC">
    <title>Knock Internal State7 Minimum Clamp</title>
    <description>[BMS46 v0.52 CODE-DERIVED] In the knock-control routine, after a helper result is stored in D7 and the state byte reaches 7, the high byte of D7 is compared with 0x9DED; if lower, D7 is replaced by 0x9DED shifted left by 8. Q28G raw=15. Thus 0x9DED is a state-7 minimum clamp in the internal knock-controller word. The physical engineering unit of that internal word is not asserted.</description>
