  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x624F" vislevel="1" flags="0xC">
    <title>EFAN Vehicle Speed Upper Threshold</title>
    <description>[BMS46 v0.53 CODE-DERIVED] In the EFAN control path around 0x23E14, calibration 0x81EE is compared directly with Vehicle_Speed FF832D. When speed reaches/exceeds 0x81EE, the EFAN state flag FF880F bit3 is set. The same path forms the lower release threshold as 0x81EE - 0x81EF. FF832D scaling is established as 1 km/h per bit. Q28G raw=120 -&gt; 120 km/h.</description>
