  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x6250" vislevel="1" flags="0xC">
    <title>EFAN Vehicle Speed Hysteresis</title>
    <description>[BMS46 v0.53 CODE-DERIVED / PAIRED SINGLE-XREF] In the EFAN control path around 0x23E14, code computes 0x81EE - 0x81EF and compares that result with Vehicle_Speed FF832D before clearing the EFAN speed-state flag. With 0x81EE=120 and 0x81EF=20, the lower transition is 100 km/h. Therefore 0x81EF is the vehicle-speed hysteresis width. Q28G raw=20 -&gt; 20 km/h.</description>
