    <description>[BMS46 v0.53 CODE-DERIVED] In both A/C compressor state-machine branches at 0x288D0 and 0x28972, Engine_RPM FF8334 is compared directly with 0x827B before entry-state bits/countdowns are armed. FF8334 scaling is established as 40 RPM per bit. Q28G raw=75 -&gt; 3000 RPM. This is the upper RPM gate for these A/C compressor state transitions.</description>
