    <title>AC Compressor State Holdoff Countdown</title>
    <description>[BMS46 v0.53 CODE-DERIVED] In the paired A/C compressor state-machine branches at 0x288F4 and 0x2899A, once the 0x827C entry countdown expires, 0x827E is loaded into the following state/holdoff counter while the transition-state bit is asserted. Q28G raw=75. This is a state holdoff/countdown value; no wall-clock conversion is asserted.</description>
