    <title>Lambda Adaptation Master Enable</title>
    <description>[BMS46 v0.54 CODE-DERIVED / EXPERT] ROM byte 0x85C4 is tested in calculate_Engine_Injection before applying the dynamic Q15 multiplier FF8500, and it is tested again in the lambda-adaptation update path before learned updates are allowed. Q28G stock=1. Zero disables this master adaptation/dynamic-multiplier path; nonzero enables it. Kept in Expert / internal adaptation because disabling it changes closed-loop adaptation behavior globally.</description>
